      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
      "label": "The text 'i grew up in a household' is mapped onto the visual scene of the historical household.",
      "description": "The text 'i grew up in a household where talking back got your ass whooped' is directly mapped onto the visual material of the historical household scene. The entire scene, including the adult male, the woman disciplining the child, and the fearful children, represents the 'household' referenced in the text. The visual material serves as the embodiment of the textual description, creating an analogical mapping where the household depicted is the 'household' the speaker claims to have grown up in.",
